--bound 1
^Type-checking Verilog::main$
^Synthesis Verilog::main$
^EXIT=2$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
unexpected statement
^Invariant check failed$
--
The release statement is accepted by the type checker and by symbol
collection during elaboration. Previously it triggered an invariant
violation (abort) in collect_symbols; it now reaches synthesis and fails
with a clean conversion error instead.
